# WINDSURF PROJECT RULES — LENS DESIGN SYSTEM

## MANDATE
This project uses ONLY `@loomhq/lens@12.14.0`. No other UI library permitted.

## KEY DIFFERENCES FROM OTHER LIBRARIES
- Layout: <Container> (not Box), <Split> (not Flex), <Arrange> (not Grid)
- Typography: <Text size="heading-lg" htmlTag="h1"> (no Heading component)
- Boolean props: isDisabled, hasLoader (not disabled, loading)
- Element override: htmlTag="a" (not as="a")
- Refs: refHandler={(r) => ref.current = r} (not ref={ref})
- Icons: <Icon icon={<SvgName />} /> with Svg prefix
- Spacing: "small"/"medium"/"large" tokens (not numbers)
- Button icons: iconBefore/iconAfter (not leftIcon/rightIcon)

## RULES
1. ALL UI from `@loomhq/lens` exclusively
2. Container/Split/Arrange for layout — never raw div
3. Text component for ALL typography — never raw p/h1-h6/span
4. Named spacing tokens (xsmall/small/medium/large/xlarge/xxlarge)
5. Lens color tokens for all colors
6. NEVER create CSS files or use className/style
7. NEVER import from other UI libraries

## REFERENCE
- Docs: .lens-knowledge-base/components.md
- Styles: .lens-knowledge-base/styles.md
- Site: https://lens.loom.dev
